		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Skinless, bloody centaur. This saltwater faerie is manifested from blight and pollution.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 30, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 longsword +5 (1d8) or pestilent breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Disease</strong>. 1d4 CON damage (can't heal while ill). Make CON 12+ check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fresh Water Vulnerability</strong>. Avoids fresh water. A flask of fresh water does 4d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Pestilent Breath</strong>. Fills a near- sized cube extending from nuckelavee. CON 12+ or 3d6 damage and diseased.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
